)(x - a) 和 y = g′(a)(x - a) 如图 4.34 所示。我们知道在 x = a 附近，线性化提供了函数的良好近似。事实上，"},{"x":0.11834,"y":0.4118,"w":0.08699,"h":0.01302,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"t":"y = f′(a)(x − a)"},{"x":0.19383,"y":0.43711,"w":0.0198,"h":0.01142,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"t":"f(x)"},{"x":0.21537,"y":0.46191,"w":0.08833,"h":0.01302,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"t":"y = g′(a)(x − a)"},{"x":0.36735,"y":0.47482,"w":0.50087,"h":0.01766,"fs":0.02542,"n":1,"t":"f(x) = f′(a)(x - a) + P1(x - a) 和 g(x) = g′(a)(x - a) + P2(x - a)"},{"x":0.22551,"y":0.48135,"w":0.02107,"h":0.01142,"fs":0.01023,"n":1,"t":"g(x)"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.49731,"w":0.42588,"h":0.02074,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"其中 P1 ≥ 0 和 P2 ≥ 0，当 x → a 时。所以，如图 4.34 所示，"},{"x":0.03884,"y":0.50211,"w":0.07142,"h":0.01142,"fs":0.01023,"n":2,"t":"0 a"},{"x":0.56883,"y":0.52022,"w":0.17617,"h":0.02493,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"f′(a)(x - a) + P1(x - a)"},{"x":0.48991,"y":0.52138,"w":0.03054,"h":0.02376,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"f(x)"},{"x":0.49418,"y":0.53025,"w":0.07352,"h":0.02443,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"g(x) = limx→a"},{"x":0.46597,"y":0.53087,"w":0.0239,"h":0.02242,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"limx→a"},{"x":0.5731,"y":0.53743,"w":0.1719,"h":0.01766,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"g′(a)(x - a) + P2(x - a)"},{"x":0.5449,"y":0.54123,"w":0.0239,"h":0.01206,"fs":0.00895,"n":1,"t":"x→a"},{"x":0.04849,"y":0.55677,"w":0.229,"h":0.04654,"fs":0.01151,"n":3,"t":"图 4.34 洛必达法则中的两个函数，以及它们在 x = a 处的线性近似。"},{"x":0.56883,"y":0.55859,"w":0.07491,"h":0.02493,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"f′(a) + P1"},{"x":0.5731,"y":0.55869,"w":0.12782,"h":0.03732,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"g′(a) + P2 = f′(a)"},{"x":0.52054,"y":0.56862,"w":0.04716,"h":0.01723,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"= limx→a"},{"x":0.66825,"y":0.56924,"w":0.15808,"h":0.02283,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"g′(a) g′(a) ≠0"},{"x":0.5449,"y":0.5796,"w":0.0239,"h":0.01206,"fs":0.00895,"n":1,"t":"x→a"},{"x":0.56883,"y":0.59706,"w":0.03599,"h":0.02482,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"f′(x)"},{"x":0.52054,"y":0.60698,"w":0.04716,"h":0.01723,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"= limx→a"},{"x":0.5731,"